# Never ship into the build context:
#  - secrets (.env in any variant, proxy credential files)
#  - local databases (.data and any backup of it)
#  - installed modules (the image runs its own npm ci against the lockfile)
node_modules
web/node_modules
.env
.env.*
proxies.txt
proxies*.txt
.data
.data*
web/dist
dist
logs
*.log
.git
.claude
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
docs
scripts
DESIGN.md
web/DESIGN_AUDIT.md
fixtures
